372 __ |a The Swedish Assembly of Finland (Folktinget) is an organisation 
          with the statutory task of safeguarding the Swedish language and the 
          interests of the Swedish-speaking population of Finland. Folktinget 
          participates in the law-drafting process and issues statements to 
          governmental institutions on issues concerning the Swedish-speaking 
          population. Folktinget is a cross-political body; all parliamentary 
          parties with activities in Swedish are members of Folktinget. |v 
